OUTPUT
- Language: {{ language_instruction }}
- JSON with fields: headline (under 90 characters), overview (90 to 150 words), areas (love, career, wellness, money: each an object with `text` of 30 to 60 words), affirmation (one short sentence), citations (array of factor IDs).
- Warm, calibrated, practical. Plain text; no HTML.
